{"bvid": "BV1qV411d72v", "title": "【英语口语】为什么你学了十年英语还是说不出口？英国爷爷分享如何有效提升口语水平｜告别哑巴英语｜全英中字", "duration": 439, "subs": [{"cid": 185874025, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 172, "body": [{"from": 0.0, "to": 3.26, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "我在中国当了七年的英语老师"}, {"from": 3.26, "to": 5.76, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "我被告知的第一件事是"}, {"from": 5.76, "to": 6.24, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "哦"}, {"from": 6.24, "to": 10.81, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "我已经学英语十年了，可还是不会说"}, {"from": 10.81, "to": 13.1, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "那么这里的问题是什么"}, {"from": 21.08, "to": 22.08, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "我的一些学生"}, {"from": 22.08, "to": 22.68, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "比如说"}, {"from": 22.68, "to": 25.16, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "我从他们开始，我说这个怎么样"}, {"from": 25.16, "to": 26.32, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "你对此有什么看法"}, {"from": 26.32, "to": 29.08, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "他们完全舌头打结了"}, {"from": 29.4, "to": 30.74, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "就像他们的舌头被绑住了"}, {"from": 30.74, "to": 31.72, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "他们不能说话"}, {"from": 31.72, "to": 33.36, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "他们什么都不能说"}, {"from": 33.36, "to": 35.76, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "然后在喜欢之后"}, {"from": 35.76, "to": 38.06, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "也许几个月或几个星期"}, {"from": 38.06, "to": 41.24, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "甚至突然间一切都开始显现出来"}, {"from": 41.24, "to": 41.92, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "它是什么"}, {"from": 41.92, "to": 43.32, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "就像一座冰山"}, {"from": 43.34, "to": 47.22, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "在表面之下是大量的英语知识"}, {"from": 47.22, "to": 48.52, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "但它出来了"}, {"from": 48.52, "to": 50.18, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "它把它拿出来了"}, {"from": 50.18, "to": 54.95, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "这就是问题所在，中国的主要问题是你有这么大的班级"}, {"from": 54.95, "to": 58.7, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "你真的没有足够的机会练习"}, {"from": 58.7, "to": 61.58, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "关键是自信"}, {"from": 61.58, "to": 65.12, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "克服你的害羞和自信"}, {"from": 65.2, "to": 69.4, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "关键是要有一段关系"}, {"from": 69.4, "to": 72.54, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "所以尽管你可以学习到脸色发青"}, {"from": 72.54, "to": 78.0, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "学习单词列表等等，你真正需要的是什么来获得你的英语"}, {"from": 78.0, "to": 79.74, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "最好是练习"}, {"from": 79.74, "to": 80.76, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "社会实践"}, {"from": 82.12, "to": 82.96, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "与外国人的谈话"}, {"from": 82.96, "to": 84.88, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "当然是理想的"}, {"from": 84.88, "to": 88.52, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "但如果你不能和同事进行这种对话"}, {"from": 88.52, "to": 91.96, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "有趣的是张在那里有两个朋友"}, {"from": 91.96, "to": 94.72, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "他们中的一个没有得到很多练习"}, {"from": 94.72, "to": 99.93, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "和他的另一个朋友在同一时间和同一水平开始"}, {"from": 99.93, "to": 102.36, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "另一个朋友有了聊天伙伴"}, {"from": 102.56, "to": 106.04, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "大约两年后，我和他们两个都核实了一下"}, {"from": 106.04, "to": 108.38, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "她几乎会双语"}, {"from": 108.38, "to": 109.44, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "完全流利"}, {"from": 109.44, "to": 111.09, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "他还在挣扎"}, {"from": 111.09, "to": 115.93, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "社交场合是真正打破僵局并让你前进的地方"}, {"from": 115.93, "to": 119.08, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "让文字现在流动"}, {"from": 119.08, "to": 120.7, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "当谈到发音时"}, {"from": 120.7, "to": 124.6, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "我注意到中国学生很快乐"}, {"from": 124.6, "to": 125.64, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "只是重复单词"}, {"from": 126.68, "to": 127.76, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "所以是的"}, {"from": 127.76, "to": 129.139, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "在发音方面"}, {"from": 129.139, "to": 130.199, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "有人说了些什么"}, {"from": 130.199, "to": 131.46, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "你只要复制它"}, {"from": 131.46, "to": 132.3, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "我想得很好"}, {"from": 132.3, "to": 133.34, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "那是鹦鹉学舌式的时尚"}, {"from": 133.34, "to": 134.22, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "我刚来的时候"}, {"from": 134.22, "to": 135.579, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "你不应该那样学"}, {"from": 135.579, "to": 138.419, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "但实际上中国学生已经很习惯了"}, {"from": 138.419, "to": 141.93, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "这是一种非常非常有效的学习方式"}, {"from": 141.93, "to": 144.6, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "让我们看看其他的方法"}, {"from": 144.82, "to": 149.76, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "上培训学校是提高英语口语的好方法"}, {"from": 149.76, "to": 152.1, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "可能是最好的，你说"}, {"from": 152.1, "to": 152.34, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "哦好吧"}, {"from": 152.34, "to": 152.94, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "它很贵"}, {"from": 152.94, "to": 153.22, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "是呀"}, {"from": 153.22, "to": 157.46, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "但人们在上面花钱的事实表明它是有用的"}, {"from": 157.46, "to": 159.3, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "它真的有效"}, {"from": 159.3, "to": 162.26, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "但如果你一个人做不到"}, {"from": 162.26, "to": 165.44, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "最有效的方法之一就是看电影"}, {"from": 165.44, "to": 168.98, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "我和我的学生谈过，他们非常"}, {"from": 168.98, "to": 169.72, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "非常流利"}, {"from": 169.72, "to": 174.45, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "他们说我把同一部电影看了三四遍"}, {"from": 174.45, "to": 177.38, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "我每周看两三部电影"}, {"from": 177.5, "to": 183.28, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "所以他们在社交场合中接触到了很多英语的使用"}, {"from": 183.28, "to": 184.62, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "通过电影"}, {"from": 184.679, "to": 189.199, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "最简单最好的方法是使用字幕"}, {"from": 189.199, "to": 190.899, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "你开始"}, {"from": 194.89, "to": 196.13, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "那你就有英语了"}, {"from": 196.13, "to": 197.61, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "只有字幕"}, {"from": 197.61, "to": 200.21, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "那你就没有字幕了"}, {"from": 200.21, "to": 202.07, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "你停止了电影"}, {"from": 202.07, "to": 203.76, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "你听它"}, {"from": 203.76, "to": 205.69, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "你重复他们说的话"}, {"from": 205.69, "to": 206.99, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "你重新开始"}, {"from": 206.99, "to": 208.25, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "有时被称为跟踪"}, {"from": 208.25, "to": 209.83, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "有时这是在课堂上做的"}, {"from": 209.83, "to": 210.63, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "这样"}, {"from": 210.63, "to": 212.05, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "它很受欢迎"}, {"from": 212.05, "to": 213.45, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "人们真的很喜欢它"}, {"from": 213.45, "to": 215.22, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "他们真的从中吸取教训"}, {"from": 215.22, "to": 221.41, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "所以现在用这种方式使用电影和视频是一种很好的学习方式"}, {"from": 221.41, "to": 224.45, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "我一直认为最好的方式是读书"}, {"from": 224.45, "to": 227.8, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "如果人们能学会读很多书"}, {"from": 227.94, "to": 232.36, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "然后他们就明白了整个英国人的思维方式"}, {"from": 232.36, "to": 235.16, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "因为否则只是学习这个句子或那个句子"}, {"from": 235.16, "to": 236.38, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "你没学到这么多"}, {"from": 236.38, "to": 238.83, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "但最重要的是"}, {"from": 238.83, "to": 241.03, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "那就是把水平弄对"}, {"from": 241.03, "to": 242.69, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "别太有野心"}, {"from": 242.69, "to": 247.019, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "不要试图立即阅读大英百科全书"}, {"from": 247.019, "to": 251.17, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "或者一些复杂的世界历史什么的"}, {"from": 251.17, "to": 252.37, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "儿童读物"}, {"from": 252.37, "to": 253.45, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "非常好的方式"}, {"from": 253.45, "to": 255.29, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "我喜欢丁丁的书"}, {"from": 255.29, "to": 257.11, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "里面有照片"}, {"from": 257.11, "to": 259.13, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "它们很适合给你的孩子读书"}, {"from": 259.13, "to": 261.89, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "也是为了自己学习"}, {"from": 261.89, "to": 265.699, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "虽然我必须说我真的很讨厌哈利波特"}, {"from": 265.699, "to": 269.059, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "哈利波特在这里非常受欢迎"}, {"from": 269.059, "to": 270.339, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "我有过一些人"}, {"from": 270.339, "to": 272.159, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "我有过很认真的学生"}, {"from": 272.159, "to": 272.939, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "高级"}, {"from": 272.939, "to": 279.08, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "用乐高搭建整个哈利波特的成熟学生"}, {"from": 279.08, "to": 279.84, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "你知道吗"}, {"from": 279.84, "to": 282.22, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "他们读过哈利波特的每一本书"}, {"from": 282.22, "to": 285.26, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "他们看过哈利波特的每一部电影"}, {"from": 285.64, "to": 288.2, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "所以如果你真的想提高你的英语水平"}, {"from": 288.2, "to": 291.69, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "你可以忍受阅读女巫和巫术"}, {"from": 291.69, "to": 293.29, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "所有我恨自己的事"}, {"from": 293.29, "to": 295.68, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "但这对你的英语有好处"}, {"from": 295.68, "to": 296.68, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "这很常见"}, {"from": 296.68, "to": 297.98, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "很多人都这么做"}, {"from": 297.98, "to": 300.0, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "你得到一些帖子"}, {"from": 300.12, "to": 302.16, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "这样你就可以粘在你的东西上"}, {"from": 302.16, "to": 303.97, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "你在上面加上英语单词"}, {"from": 303.97, "to": 305.85, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "你把它弹出来"}, {"from": 305.85, "to": 307.79, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "像桌椅"}, {"from": 307.79, "to": 308.75, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "橱柜"}, {"from": 308.75, "to": 310.34, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "餐厅"}, {"from": 313.94, "to": 315.54, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "垫子之类的"}, {"from": 315.54, "to": 316.46, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "你把柱子"}, {"from": 316.46, "to": 317.3, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "到处都是音符"}, {"from": 317.3, "to": 318.32, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "当你四处走动"}, {"from": 318.32, "to": 320.76, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "你大声说出这些话"}, {"from": 329.92, "to": 333.04, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "练习你的英语口语"}, {"from": 333.04, "to": 333.2, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "是啊，是啊"}, {"from": 333.2, "to": 336.1, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "有很多外国人在中国的城市里游荡"}, {"from": 336.1, "to": 339.08, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "他们不知道自己在哪里，也不知道要去哪里"}, {"from": 339.08, "to": 340.36, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "你上去对他们说"}, {"from": 340.36, "to": 341.34, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "我能帮你吗？"}, {"from": 341.34, "to": 343.38, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "有时这是一件很简单的事情"}, {"from": 343.38, "to": 345.159, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "你可以帮助他们，告诉他们"}, {"from": 345.159, "to": 347.439, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "我就这样和一个男人交上了朋友"}, {"from": 347.439, "to": 350.979, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "结果我和他是几年的好朋友"}, {"from": 350.979, "to": 353.07, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "他得到了很多练习"}, {"from": 353.07, "to": 354.25, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "他帮了我很多"}, {"from": 354.25, "to": 354.69, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "我也是"}, {"from": 354.69, "to": 357.35, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "你会在我们的doen视频中注意到"}, {"from": 357.35, "to": 363.47, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "我们通常只是拿一个词，举一个例子来说明它是如何使用的"}, {"from": 363.47, "to": 365.1, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "这真的是关键"}, {"from": 365.1, "to": 366.62, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "从教学的角度来看"}, {"from": 366.62, "to": 368.1, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "从学习的角度来看"}, {"from": 368.1, "to": 371.58, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "你试图找到去某个地方的路的情况"}, {"from": 371.58, "to": 373.62, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "那是我最受欢迎的视频之一"}, {"from": 373.62, "to": 374.92, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "请问洗手间在哪里？"}, {"from": 376.04, "to": 378.44, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "这才是真正驱使你学习一门语言的原因"}, {"from": 378.44, "to": 381.329, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "是因为你有事情要尽快做对吧"}, {"from": 381.329, "to": 384.38, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "你很快就学会了这门语言"}, {"from": 384.52, "to": 387.12, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "所以上下文很重要"}, {"from": 387.12, "to": 390.409, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "你如何使用这个短语或单词"}, {"from": 390.409, "to": 392.569, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "我很喜欢这种关系"}, {"from": 392.569, "to": 396.089, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "我和我的粉丝在豆音视频上"}, {"from": 396.089, "to": 398.15, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "还有豆音"}, {"from": 400.79, "to": 402.35, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "比利比利也"}, {"from": 402.35, "to": 405.77, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "我们有我自己的评论"}, {"from": 405.77, "to": 409.44, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "但也有你们观众的评论"}, {"from": 409.44, "to": 412.92, "sid": 164, "location": 2, "content": "所以这样你就得到了一些互动"}, {"from": 413.099, "to": 415.299, "sid": 165, "location": 2, "content": "这有助于建立关系"}, {"from": 415.299, "to": 418.099, "sid": 166, "location": 2, "content": "这是提高英语水平的关键"}, {"from": 418.099, "to": 422.939, "sid": 167, "location": 2, "content": "所以在所有这些频道上成为我的粉丝和追随者"}, {"from": 422.939, "to": 429.19, "sid": 168, "location": 2, "content": "也可以对你想让我讨论的任何话题发表评论"}, {"from": 429.19, "to": 430.99, "sid": 169, "location": 2, "content": "你问的任何问题"}, {"from": 430.99, "to": 433.41, "sid": 170, "location": 2, "content": "我不保证回答每一个问题"}, {"from": 433.41, "to": 434.15, "sid": 171, "location": 2, "content": "但如果我可以"}, {"from": 434.15, "to": 434.72, "sid": 172, "location": 2, "content": "我会的"}]}]}